        "number": 8,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "-ing Adjectives -ed Adjectives Other Adjectives 1 That house was fascinating. We all are fascinated by her performance. It was a hellish island. 2 What an interesting idea. I will be interested in learning about it. He was in a critical condition. 3 This will be a surprising event. They were all surprised. You never clean; it is all dusty. There are also some other endings for adjectives 4 That man was so mysterious. You need to be grateful. She has a melodic voice.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "-ing Adjectives -ed Adjectives Other Adjectives 1 That house was fascinating. We all are fascinated by her performance. It was a hellish island. 2 What an interesting idea. I will be interested in learning about it. He was in a critical condition. 3 This will be a surprising event. They were all surprised. You never clean; it is all dusty. There are also some other endings for adjectives 4 That man was so mysterious. You need to be grateful. She has a melodic voice.",
          "As we know, we use adjectives to describe characteristics and qualities about people, places and things. However, adjectives may be used differently depending on what they describe."
        ],
