        "number": 11,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "Although adjectives happen to be in a variety of contexts, their main function is to describe.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Although adjectives happen to be in a variety of contexts, their main function is to describe.",
          "Functions Examples 1 Describe situations or things that affect people. I have to admit that was a fascinating lesson. The spa was so relaxing. 2 Describe how people feel by any situation or thing. The audience is amused. Have you heard the story of the crooked man?",
          "To consider Some adjectives like crooked / naked do not follow the regular pronunciation rule for -ED endings. This may be because of the origin of the word or because there is no corresponding verb to the adjective."
