      {
        "number": 14,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "C. Read the following paragraph and extract sentences with the functions studied, and locate them in the space provided.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "C. Read the following paragraph and extract sentences with the functions studied, and locate them in the space provided.",
          "B. Listen to the audio and answer the questions your teacher makes.",
          "Gone to College It has been such an exciting moment in my life. My name is Diane, and I am now a college student. I was always interested in how leaving the house and coming to college would be. I must say it is breathtaking. Of course, I have tons of responsibilities and time-consuming activities but I feel blessed that my parents were able to send me here. Don’t get me wrong, there are some boring lessons and tiring lectures, but most of it is amazing. Spending time with my friends and being surrounded by people with similar interests make me feel fortunate and grateful. Are you looking forward to living this experience?"
        ],
        "links": [],
